From 28ce75f62c4523efd33b67ba0062b449dd4f2ca3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luca Weiss <luca@lucaweiss.eu>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 17:00:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 051/107] */*: Remove dangling /usr/lib/modules/*/build symlink
 after usr-merge

When updating INSTALL_MOD_PATH to include /usr, updating the 'rm'
command was forgotten, and 'rm -f' doesn't complain if the file is not
actually present.

Update the command to not use force, which also means removing '/source'
from the command, since that won't be installed by the install process.

[ci:skip-kconfigcheck] # not relevant here
[ci:skip-build] # armv7 validated on CI, aarch64 validated locally

Part-of: <https://gitlab.nura.eco/nura/pmaports/-/merge_requests/9885>
